text 16,331 464x34 f1 left c4 m1 ink 16,331 434x34 | Every book needs a plant of its own, in
text 16,365 464x34 f1 left c4 m1 ink 16,365 409x34 | the cubby above, below or beside it.
text 16,416 464x34 f1 left c4 m1 ink 16,416 393x34 | Plants never touch each other, not
text 16,450 464x34 f1 left c4 m1 ink 16,450 190x34 | even at a corner.
text 16,501 464x34 f1 left c4 m1 ink 16,501 393x34 | The numbers say how many plants
text 16,535 464x34 f1 left c4 m1 ink 16,535 437x34 | each row and column holds. A number
text 16,569 464x34 f1 left c4 m1 ink 16,569 361x34 | turns solid when its line is right.
text 16,620 464x34 f1 left c4 m1 ink 16,620 428x34 | Tap a cubby for a plant, again to cross
text 16,654 464x34 f1 left c4 m1 ink 16,654 301x34 | it out, and again to clear it.
